            "notes": "Grab [Packstacker](item_87b99cde-3089-42fd-86bc-6e1ebf3fe422). This, paired with [Optimizer](item_13d41c37-8f79-4435-9d81-c9599955f6a8) greatly improves your survivability by making sure you have a steady healing on yourself. It also pairs super well with [Nullifier Neuroworks](item_6501be99-b951-4dad-9bb5-8305eb17d84e).\n\nThis round you want to pick up [Nullifier Neuroworks](item_6501be99-b951-4dad-9bb5-8305eb17d84e). It drastically reduces the cooldown on your repair packs, allowing you to pretty much have a steady stream of repair packs. \n\nIf they **don't** have a Kiriko, then take [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505). If they do, then take [Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e).\n\nFocus on peeling, play around cover, use your shield, but don't be afraid to get up close. (You need to make hits with your weapon for the cooldown reduction on the repair packs.)",
