            "notes": "If their damage output was crazy in round 6 and is shredding your tank, I recommend taking [Lindholm Wall](item_a733a6f5-72cd-43cd-a0fd-b1e03fa34753) and take on the role of a backup tank. If you've been able to get up close and be offensive, take [Sk\u00f6ldkastning](item_a6c36dee-d961-428b-b27c-93ba5ef377d8) to increase your damage and proc more inspire.\n\nIf going more defensive, I like to take [Hardlight Weave](item_0e674b2f-4048-4fc9-be6d-95d51d2ae33b), especially when paired with [Lindholm Wall](item_a733a6f5-72cd-43cd-a0fd-b1e03fa34753). However, [Scavenged Steel](item_fb9d2d13-db05-46fa-b3c6-07495b1872a4) is super nice if you're able to output constant ability damage. I usually go for [Scavenged Steel](item_fb9d2d13-db05-46fa-b3c6-07495b1872a4) paired with [Sk\u00f6ldkastning](item_a6c36dee-d961-428b-b27c-93ba5ef377d8).",
